{"id":"steam-1261930","steam":1261930,"igdb":null,"type":"dlc","title":"911FR: Highway Patrol","summary":"Choose your patrol cruiser, take a disp call and start the duty with new Highway Patrol DLC.","about":"911FR: Highway Patrol - the first expansion for the game 911FR created by our teams inspired by the Highway Patrol of the state of California. Our goal is to convey the main features of the organization to adapt its features to our realities.\r\n\r\n\nSupplement carries:\n\r\n\r\n\n•  5 new cars\r\n•  4 new characters\r\n\n\r\n\r\nCreating machines, we were inspired and tried to capture two legendary sedans. Two cars that together were, are, and we hope to continue the service as in the police and highway patrol. The first is a classic COP frame sedan, the last tens of years of hard service—the second - designed to enhance the ranks of, to support and strengthen the officers.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAnd we have four new officers, the shape of which is made in the spirit of the prototype. The names and biographies, so not random. We tried to perpetuate if I may say so, the memory of the past.\r\n\r\nWe wish you a fun game along with our first expansion pack!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1261930/capsule_616x353.jpg?t=1583942992","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1261930/header.jpg?t=1583942992","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1261930/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1583942992","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1261930/header.jpg?t=1583942992","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1261930/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1583942992","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1261930/ss_b38872fb8585715d631cd6e14bd45bd0b340f395.600x338.jpg?t=1583942992","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a